YLog [SimTalk]
Activates logarithmic representation (true) of the y-axis of the Chart designated by <Path> or deactivates
it (false).
Remarks
If you activate YLog, you also have to enter a value greater than 0, for example 0.1, for the YScaleMin, so
that Plant Simulation can display the scale logarithmically.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.YLog:boolean
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type boolean.
Example
MyChart.YLog := false
SimTalk
XLog [SimTalk]
See also
Logarithmic Y-axis
YScaleMin [SimTalk]
YLog [SimTalk]
